 "guid": "29F37637-48C9-4B72-93E9-737825C14100",
 "comment": "Five series, each a non-recursive Directory.GetFiles over its own source root, sorted ordinal-ignore-case, classified by extension. Every asset gets an OutputDirectory of its own -- xna4-diagnostic\\Content\\<series>\\<assetName> -- which is why each reference is <series>/<stem>/<stem>.xnb and why each series is its own output root here. Windows, CompressContent false, RebuildAll true. The runner also sets processor parameters as plain MSBuild metadata for the 2d-shooters series only, and every one of them is the processor's own default measured in tests/reference/xna40/graphics/graphics-content-oracle.json -- ColorKeyColor 255,0,255,255, ColorKeyEnabled True, GenerateMipmaps False, PremultiplyAlpha True, ResizeToPowerOfTwo False, TextureFormat Color for TextureProcessor, Quality Best for SoundEffectProcessor -- so whether BuildContent reads unprefixed metadata as a parameter cannot change what was built. MakeSquare, and the FontDescriptionProcessor's PremultiplyAlpha and TextureFormat, are not XNA 4.0 properties at all. No parameters are written for that reason.",
 "units": [
